library-core (QuAlgLib)
Copyright 2026 Henry

This repository aggregates quantum algorithm implementations from multiple upstream sources.
Original authorship and license for each vendored algorithm is preserved in that algorithm's
directory (see PROVENANCE.md alongside it) and summarized here as sources are added.

Vendored sources (see each algorithm's PROVENANCE.md for full detail):

- Qiskit (https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit), Apache-2.0 — pattern-level reimplementations of
  Grover's algorithm, Quantum Phase Estimation, and Trotterized TFIM simulation.

See docs/SOURCES.md for the full source ledger, including sources under evaluation.
